f"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids came in under 90% of normal in April to May 38 of 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle ran 63% of normal in September to October and 62% in October to November. So far in 2026 it ran 187% of normal in May to June. Grid 12755 had its driest year in 2000 at 64%.</p>"}
